19
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,040
(Find them)

20
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,640
(and put them in the right order)

21
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:50,719
(in the empty display frames
behind you.)

22
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,560
(Bring back one petal at a time.)

23
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,920
(You have sixty minutes.)

24
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:57,519
(If you fail,)

25
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,319
(all your collections)

26
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:01,159
(will be put on public display.)

27
